  "notes": [
    "Subscription-equivalent USD uses the same published base prices but excludes long-context uplifts; it is an estimate, not an invoice or a credit-to-dollar exchange rate.",
    "API USD retains published long-context prices. Sol promotional prices are already applied in both USD branches.",
    "Credits follow the published subscription token rate card without importing API long-context uplifts. Cache-write credits remain unspecified.",
    "Historical records are revalued at this observed price snapshot and marked as estimates, not historical invoices.",
    "Sol promotion is available at least through 2026-11-21. No unannounced post-promotion price is assumed.",
    "GPT-5.4 and GPT-5.4 mini use their independently published Standard token rates. GPT-5.4 API prices above 272K use 2x input and 1.5x output. No unverified Fast, Flex or cache-write rates are inferred.",
    "Only documented model IDs and snapshots are included; generic gpt-image-2.5 is not inferred as a variant alias.",
    "GPT-6 Sol and GPT-6 Luna use the rates published on 2026-09-22 with 2x input, cache and cache-write rates and 1.5x output above 272K input tokens. Fast mode maps to the priority tier at 2x; credits have no Fast rate configured.",
    "Anthropic rules use the published Claude API prices. Subscription-equivalent USD uses the same base prices; it is an estimate, not a Claude subscription invoice.",
    "Anthropic cacheWrite is the 5-minute cache write price and cacheWrite1h the 1-hour price; records without a TTL split stay unpriced when cache writes are present.",
    "Claude fast mode maps to the priority tier for Opus 5.5 and Opus 5, with the published fast input and output prices and cache multipliers applied on top. US-only inference (1.1x) and web search fees are not applied.",
    "Claude models on the current price list include the full context window at standard prices, so no long-context tier is configured.",
    "Only Claude model IDs and aliases listed on the official models overview are configured: claude-fable-5-1, claude-opus-5-5, claude-opus-5 (legacy), claude-sonnet-5, claude-haiku-4-5-20251001 and its alias claude-haiku-4-5. Other models stay unpriced."
  ],
